{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_2026020901234661ff9caf72a6455e","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on the brainstorming skill and analysis of previous implementations, I need to choose a completely new distinctive aesthetic direction for **Clínica BotoEsthetic**. Let me analyze:\n\n**Previous palettes used:**\n1. Ethereal Rose & Gold\n2. Serene Sage & Pearl\n3. Twilight Lavender & Mocha\n4. Ethereal Emerald & Silk\n5. Opulent Rose & Quartz\n6. Amber & Bronze Noir\n7. Velvet Plum & Gold Noir\n8. Sapphire Noir & Champagne\n9. Pearl & Mink Noir\n10. Opal & Dusty Rose Noir\n11. Coral Noir & Seafoam\n12. Regal Burgundy & Gold Noir\n13. Porcelain & Rouge Noir\n\n**New Direction for BotoEsthetic:**\nI'll choose a **Chrome Noir & Electric Violet** aesthetic - a modern, futuristic-inspired palette with cool chrome/silver tones, electric violet accents, and deep noir backgrounds. This creates a premium, cutting-edge feel that aligns with \"BotoEsthetic\" as a modern aesthetic clinic brand.\n\n**Design specifications:**\n- **Palette:** Chrome silver (#C8C8D8, #D8D8E8), Electric Violet (#8B5FC8, #A87FD8), Deep Noir (#0D0D12, #1A1A24)\n- **Typography:** Prata (display) + Figtree (body) - modern geometric sans-serif pairing\n- **Border Radius:** Prism-shard patterns with sharp crystalline angles\n- **Visual hook:** Animated prism/light refraction effects in hero"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c96d8321-48e7-4c30-aa26-744b7d13df68","uuid":"f19ec514-e982-49fb-b3e8-9bc6a9754b68"}
